02:41:43 out   Audacity 4.0 window, which is Audacity's default Play/Stop shortcut. VidCue
02:41:43 out   then raises and focuses its own window again. The link can be switched off
02:41:43 out   without stopping the video.
02:41:43 out   - **Compact controls.** The transport collapses to two short rows, with small
02:41:43 out   - play/stop buttons, a compact clock, trimmed nudge buttons and a narrower
02:41:43 out   - Audacity chip as the window gets smaller.
02:41:43 out   + square play/stop buttons, a compact clock and a narrower Audacity chip as the
02:41:43 out   + window gets smaller.
02:41:43 out   - **Accent colour setting.** The gear at the top right opens a small settings
02:41:43 out   panel with six choices: orange, yellow, green, blue, purple and red. Purple
02:41:43 out   is the default, matching the app icon.
02:41:43 out   - **File browser and drag-and-drop.** No GTK dialogs are needed.
