14:42:45 out   When **Audacity** is on, pressing Play or Stop finds the Audacity 4.0 window,
14:42:45 out   focuses it for a moment, taps Space (Audacity's default Play/Stop shortcut)
14:42:45 out   through XTest, waits briefly, then finds the VidCue window, raises it and gives
14:42:45 out   it focus again. There is deliberately no timeline synchronization: line up the
14:42:45 out   start cue in VidCue with the Audacity play head by hand, then start from either
14:42:45 out   side. Stop is sent even when the video had already reached its end, so the audio
