01:39:54 out   | Status bar height | `70 px` normal, `58 px` compact | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Status bar side padding | `18 px` normal, `12 px` compact | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Timecode font | `32 px` normal, `22 px` compact, `18 px` narrow | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Timecode area width | `280 px` normal, `200 px` compact, `160 px` narrow | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Audacity label | `14 px` normal, `12 px` compact | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Status dot | `4.5 px` radius, with a glow while following | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Compact breakpoint | `880 px` window width | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Narrowest layout breakpoint | `500 px` window width | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Smallest tested window | `460x360` | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Toast duration | `4.5 s` | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | File browser double-click window | `0.38 s` | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Theme choices | `orange, yellow, green, blue, purple, red` | user request |
01:39:54 out   | Default theme | `purple` | user request |
01:39:54 out   | Interface modes | `dark, light` | user request |
01:39:54 out   | Default interface mode | `dark` | user request |
01:39:54 out   | Settings panel | `238x128 px` popover under the gear | estimated |
01:39:54 out   | Settings panel swatch | `24 px`, spaced `34 px` apart | estimated |
01:39:54 out   The layout switches to a compact status bar below 880 px wide: the bars get
01:39:54 out   shorter, the timecode drops to 22 px, the Audacity label drops to 12 px and the
01:39:54 out   side padding shrinks. Below 500 px the timecode drops to 18 px and its area
01:39:54 out   narrows to 160 px. The built-in file browser also drops its sidebar below
01:39:54 out   540 px and uses a smaller footer.
01:39:54 out   The gear opens an appearance popover rather than a separate settings window. A
01:39:54 out   Dark / Light choice switches the whole interface; dark is the default. Choosing
01:39:54 out   a swatch changes every accent immediately: the brand mark, play icon, settings
01:39:54 out   highlights and folder highlights. Both choices are kept for the running session
01:39:54 out   and reset to dark and purple on the next launch.
