17:36:07 out   //! Audacity 4.0 timecode over the accessibility bus.
17:36:07 out   //!
17:36:07 out   //! Audacity 4.0 is a Qt application and publishes its playback position as an
17:36:07 out   //! AT-SPI accessible value (`Playback position:00 h 00 m 11.037 s`). Reading
17:36:07 out   //! that value is independent of which window is on top, so VIDSYNC can follow
17:36:07 out   //! Audacity even while it is behind another window or minimised.
17:36:07 out   //!
17:36:07 out   //! A background thread discovers the Audacity accessible tree, caches the node
17:36:07 out   //! that holds the timecode, and polls it about thirty times a second. The UI
17:36:07 out   //! only reads a small snapshot, so a slow or missing Audacity never stalls the
17:36:07 out   //! video.
